{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crave deep games that scratch the optimization itch?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This non-linear, story-driven open-ended puzzle universe runs on the actual laws of of quantum physics. This game respects your intelligence and its complexity ranges from fully guided tutorials designed for absolute beginners to brutal quantum-algorithm puzzles that takes days to solve and asynchronous PvP battles where anything can happen. Every mechanic, story beat, and puzzle trains real, in-demand skills used in Quantum Information Science.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built by experts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by the scientists behind the key papers that defined &quot;Quantum Literacy&quot;. This is a research-backed game that teaches counter-intuitive quantum thinking the way humans learn best: quietly in the background, while you\u2019re immersed in an addictive, fully interactive sandbox.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ hours of content: 70+ modules, 500+ visual puzzles, 300+ pages of interactive encyclopedia</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asynchronous PvP: hack other players creations, make content, climb zachlike leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full sandbox mode: build any classical or quantum system, import to visualize any algorithm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boolean logic: bits, classical operators, adders and how to port to quantum equivalents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turing-complete quantum logic: qubits, complex numbers, linear algebra, custom gates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All phenomena: superposition, interference, entanglement, measurement effects, noise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All techniques: phase kickback, amplitude amplification, phase-to-signal retrieval</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous Algorithms: Deutsch\u2013Jozsa, Bernstein\u2013Vazirani, Grover\u2019s Search, QFT</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is learned from scratch, in full detail, through gameplay alone. This goes deeper than classes, textbooks, or exercises ever could because you are free to interact in any way you please with the quantum phenomena you learn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our Promise </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish the game and you'll be able to separate quantum hype from reality, know where quantum computing excels at (and where it doesn't), read field papers with confidence, form your own informed views on the technology. Most importantly, you will be able to design and think up your own quantum algorithms for any problem you choose. The industry desperately needs people from diverse backgrounds to think of new solutions. This game equips you to be one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Strange Odyssey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/dd5cb5a199d3dbec12ed915b9564d7143ec6528c.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/ae6980d0c920993953ef1f0afd38fb55ea9be4e3.jpg"},{"name":"Brilliant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/52d8dd0533dbf4b8f38fa29fd0a116dca8b72bbe.jpg"},{"name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/edd9c8cfdd9284e8ebb0e37cd2e2de8a7805e76d.jpg"},{"name":"Enlightened","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/a193c8cef9a58950a7a81087e8ffb924f69068d8.jpg"},{"name":"Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/0a58fb3ebf4874a0276ace7399ddad5c1fd53355.jpg"},{"name":"Mastermind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/9a34fbf8bc615afcc4a8047ef30fcb657a66497b.jpg"},{"name":"Member of the Community","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/1c06999348f67596c813f430898492ec19a55f57.jpg"},{"name":"Pillar of the Community","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/9835064229706551f452c4df74919d3d2b68aa9e.jpg"},{"name":"Pioneer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802710/6c65fae8fbea8b29749588d0d66631cd655ecfa0.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2802710?t=1772604373","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802710/3521f46ff9b8e662ed532c678a2d83c5e1356350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772604373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802710/4b38ec532d1cfd1a04a2a28c249d0e187d6774c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772604373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802710/4b38ec532d1cfd1a04a2a28c249d0e187d6774c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772604373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crave deep games that scratch the optimization itch?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This non-linear, story-driven open-ended puzzle universe runs on the actual laws of of quantum physics. This game respects your intelligence and its complexity ranges from fully guided tutorials designed for absolute beginners to brutal quantum-algorithm puzzles that takes days to solve and asynchronous PvP battles where anything can happen. Every mechanic, story beat, and puzzle trains real, in-demand skills used in Quantum Information Science.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built by experts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by the scientists behind the key papers that defined &quot;Quantum Literacy&quot;. This is a research-backed game that teaches counter-intuitive quantum thinking the way humans learn best: quietly in the background, while you\u2019re immersed in an addictive, fully interactive sandbox.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ hours of content: 70+ modules, 500+ visual puzzles, 300+ pages of interactive encyclopedia</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asynchronous PvP: hack other players creations, make content, climb zachlike leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full sandbox mode: build any classical or quantum system, import to visualize any algorithm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boolean logic: bits, classical operators, adders and how to port to quantum equivalents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turing-complete quantum logic: qubits, complex numbers, linear algebra, custom gates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All phenomena: superposition, interference, entanglement, measurement effects, noise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All techniques: phase kickback, amplitude amplification, phase-to-signal retrieval</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous Algorithms: Deutsch\u2013Jozsa, Bernstein\u2013Vazirani, Grover\u2019s Search, QFT</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is learned from scratch, in full detail, through gameplay alone. This goes deeper than classes, textbooks, or exercises ever could because you are free to interact in any way you please with the quantum phenomena you learn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our Promise </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish the game and you'll be able to separate quantum hype from reality, know where quantum computing excels at (and where it doesn't), read field papers with confidence, form your own informed views on the technology. Most importantly, you will be able to design and think up your own quantum algorithms for any problem you choose. The industry desperately needs people from diverse backgrounds to think of new solutions. This game equips you to be one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Quarks Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802710/d0ca633c538dd0c1e4166c67dd3cf03b5abe9592/header.jpg?t=1772604373","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\"Quantum Odyssey\" as a trademark, IP and all code behind belongs to Quarks Interactive S.R.L, CUI RO40208222.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2802710/98114368/5bbfe2c75ba37a94d8c99bd7140a4aa78516cc53/1763882159/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763884854","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2802710/98114368/5bbfe2c75ba37a94d8c99bd7140a4aa78516cc53/1763882159/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763884854","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2802710/98114368/5bbfe2c75ba37a94d8c99bd7140a4aa78516cc53/1763882159/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763884854","id":257236500,"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257236500/27ff8d63c89e8bb9dd61914b1090820c2a068107/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763884854"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2802710/66514